2"},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_21","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_21","text":"I was fair and took pictures with everyone.","jump":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_24"},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_22","text":"I knew I could count on you to tell the \"truth\".","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_23","text":"You're such a bad liar.","jump":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_28"},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_24","text":"I've always admired your honesty, Mister.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_25","text":"As for you, Sakura,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_26","text":"you shouldn't try to keep Mister all to yourself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_27","text":"You're too petty-minded for that kind of ploy.","jump":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_28"},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_28","text":"Hey, what in the heck is going on?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_29","text":"{AccountData.NickName}-kun is someone who will achieve great things in the future,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_30","text":"so I'll let this slide.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_31","text":"Is this some kind of weird role play you two are doing?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_32","text":"You're really getting into this whole \"prim and proper wife\" role.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_33","text":"It's becoming rather irksome, I must admit.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_34","text":"Think what you wish.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_35","text":"My actions won't change, no matter what.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_36","text":"Everyone, calm down.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_37","text":"Don't get too big for your britches just because I let you borrow my man.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_38","text":"You're the one","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"sakura_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_39","text":"who said we shouldn't keep him for ourselves.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"rosanna_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_40","text":"What?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_41","text":"Hey!!!!!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_42","text":"What","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_43","text":"in the world","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_44","text":"are you all","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_45","text":"talking about?!?!?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_46","text":"I'm so lost!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_47","text":"We were talking about some photos we took together.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_48","text":"Photos? Is that all?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_49","text":"I've taken plenty with Cadet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_50","text":"Are you seriously fighting over this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_51","text":"Jeez, sometimes you two can be so immature.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"moran","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_underworldqueen_06_52","text":"Don't you think so, Cadet? Hahahaha!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_underworldqueen_06_53","type":"Speech","speaker"